{"data": [{"created_at": "2026-10-27T14:22:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115086630679695513"], "id": "2115086630679695513", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2714, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114934690440458257", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "😂 这…… https://t.co/XCYlpqCZVe", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115086630679695513"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T05:31:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114953023525212546"], "id": "2114953023525212546", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 10189, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114867168072315221", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2114952872458633296", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "OpenAI 的\nhttps://t.co/Z4M6bJRXt7", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114953023525212546"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T05:30:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114952872458633296"], "id": "2114952872458633296", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 51, "impression_count": 55094, "like_count": 142, "quote_count": 12, "reply_count": 85, "retweet_count": 13}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114930095009968506", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "OpenAI 宣布 AI 推翻“指数时间假设”（ETH）的同一天，Anthropic 在 GitHub 上放出一篇论文，得出同样的结论，署名作者只有一个：Claude。\n\n论文说，核心算法是 10 月 16 日由一个内部研究版 Claude 找到的，用了 1400 万个输出 Token，没有人类输入。\n\nOpenAI 说自己的模型也是 10 月 16 https://t.co/yvrBTHWu2l", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114952872458633296"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114929069233934336"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:56:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114928688194011162", "2114929079975563269"], "id": "2114929079975563269", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 282, "impression_count": 24368, "like_count": 211, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 91, "retweet_count": 43}, "text": "推荐阅读：《用 Manus 改造 Manus，AI Native 组织改造的实践和思考》https://t.co/r3plK48zuf 来自 Manus 很好的 AI Native 组织改造一手实践分享。\n\n基于我的理解提炼一下要点：\n\n【1】团队的工程基建，从对人友好，变成了向 AI 暴露接口 https://t.co/unVxfi4pz6", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114929079975563269"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114904600159346688"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:28:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114907009350774901"], "id": "2114907009350774901", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 207, "impression_count": 23508, "like_count": 154, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 35, "retweet_count": 36}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114375050971296135", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈佛大学图书馆的馆藏里有一盘拉德克利夫研究所研讨会的录音，可以公开收听。演讲人是张爱玲，用英文讲中文翻译，主持人报的题目是「一种文化影响的载体」。目录没有标日期，从录音里提到的日期和二手资料推断是 1969 年前后。\n\n这一版先用 3 分钟讲背景。她 1920 年生在上海，去香港读过书，1940 https://t.co/w5UmDifHRG https://t.co/e3SHaAkUMn", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114907009350774901"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T23:49:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114867168072315221"], "id": "2114867168072315221", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 109, "impression_count": 69183, "like_count": 217, "quote_count": 14, "reply_count": 99, "retweet_count": 18}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114837059462627533", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "OpenAI 称 AI 推翻计算机科学的“指数时间假设”，还证出杨-米尔斯理论存在，外部专家组开始核查\n\nOpenAI 10 月 26 日宣布，内部模型在数学、计算机、物理上各拿出一项成果，其中两项碰的是几十年的难题。这些都还是 OpenAI 的说法，没经过同行评审，截至发稿也没有参与核查的专家公开评价结论对错。 https://t.co/Pw2mgE5g0z", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114867168072315221"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T21:19:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114829386897633392"], "id": "2114829386897633392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 23954, "like_count": 86, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114809857929085347", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Snap、Discord 前产品负责人 Peter Sellis 加入 X，接管产品\n\nPeter Sellis 10 月 26 日在 X 上宣布，他加入 X 担任产品负责人。这个位置 8 月起一直空着：上一任 Nikita Bier 干了一年多后卸任，转做顾问，当时 X 没有指定单一接班人，设计、产品团队分别由几个人带。\n\nSellis https://t.co/fKNrLA6DP5", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114829386897633392"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T19:18:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114798800586133628"], "id": "2114798800586133628", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 35, "impression_count": 14915, "like_count": 51, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114013404143001695", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "现在那些收订阅费的越来越难了，要么用 AI 给你破解了，要么就自己写一个 App 替代了。\n\n顺便说一下，这个刺绣 App 看起来做的还挺专业 https://t.co/9BrUXQqSwo", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114798800586133628"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T18:46:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114790675279413738"], "id": "2114790675279413738", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 91, "impression_count": 65877, "like_count": 155, "quote_count": 12, "reply_count": 99, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114780711664398349", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "OpenAI 发布 GPT-6.1 Terra：Plus 及以上订阅直接可用、不另收费，API 降价一半，操作电脑追平 GPT-6 Astra\n\nOpenAI 发布了 GPT-6.1 Terra，主打 Computer Use（操作电脑）：AI 看着屏幕上的内容，自己点鼠标、打字、在不同软件之间切换，像人一样把活干完。\n\n在 OpenAI 的几档模型里，它排在中间，比 https://t.co/Z457bMW3Nh", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114790675279413738"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T16:58:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114763608856956970"], "id": "2114763608856956970", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 138, "impression_count": 217245, "like_count": 271, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 121, "retweet_count": 42}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114749233832284411", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "微软向约 6 万名员工提供自愿离职补偿，约占全员四分之一，12 月初前决定\n\n微软 10 月 26 日（周一）给美国、加拿大、英国和印度部分团队的员工发了一份“自愿离职邀约”：愿意走的人，可以拿一笔相当于标准遣散费的补偿离开。符合条件的大约 6 万人。\n\n消息由 Bloomberg https://t.co/OfJU1UVTbN", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114763608856956970"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T14:47:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114730719255695729"], "id": "2114730719255695729", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 35, "impression_count": 23316, "like_count": 75, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114705042817110293", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic 正式递交招股书：拟在纳斯达克以 ANT 上市，发行价和估值还没定\n\nAnthropic 美国时间 10 月 26 日向美国证监会公开递交了 IPO 招股书（S-1），计划在纳斯达克上市，股票代码 ANT，高盛和摩根士丹利牵头承销。这几条在官方公告和 SEC 文件里都能查到。 https://t.co/x0T4b5Lqlg", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114730719255695729"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T06:34:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114606600883183857"], "id": "2114606600883183857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 62329, "like_count": 125, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 69, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114551467830865945", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Dario 当年在百度看起来过的还行呀，居然和 Jim Fan 还曾经是同事，承担了 Deep Speech 2 的大部分机器学习研究工作，该项目被《麻省理工科技评论》（MIT Technology Review）评为 2016 年十大突破性技术之一。\n\n2015 年还曾荣获百度第二季度“季度之星员工”（Star Employee of the Quarter）称号。 https://t.co/kGzkLKK6RU", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114606600883183857"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T02:47:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114549567790125393"], "id": "2114549567790125393", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 27711, "like_count": 83, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 104, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "Anthropic 招股书最快今天公开：拟 11 月中旬上市，募资最高约 1000 亿美元\n\n据 The Information 报道，Anthropic 最早在美国时间 10 月 26 日周一公开 IPO 招股书（S-1）。招股书是公司上市前必须交给美国证监会的一份完整账本，收入、亏损、大客户、合作方分成、谁掌握控制权都要写进去。Anthropic 6", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114549567790125393"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T00:43:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114518128910897640"], "id": "2114518128910897640", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 43157, "like_count": 267, "quote_count": 15, "reply_count": 181, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114377706603429899", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Opus 5.5 是真的好，几乎全能，有了它我几乎都很少用其他模型，以至于 Tibo 的 Reset 我都不太关心了 https://t.co/RPydsX1J0I", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114518128910897640"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T21:43:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114472846252535829"], "id": "2114472846252535829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 7025, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114469269823992179", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "注：我不是历史博主，只是在测试用模型生成不同类型视频，这个视频\nskill：https://t.co/4oSjAEMALt，\n旁白配音 Gemini TTS，\n模型 Opus 5.5\n\n提示词：\n\n把 &lt;人名&gt; &lt;年份&gt; 在 &lt;场合&gt; 的演讲做成历史视频：\n前面用 3–4", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114472846252535829"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114468000157847552"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:28:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114469269823992179"], "id": "2114469269823992179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 50, "impression_count": 15624, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114375050971296135", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "宋美龄 1943 年国会演讲原声：别低估日本，想好战后\n\n1943 年 2 月 18 日，宋美龄在华盛顿的美国国会众议院厅发表演讲。美国参议院的藏品页说，她是第二位在国会联席会议上讲话的女性，也是第一位来自中国的人。这条视频用的是美国国家档案馆保存的 21 分钟原声，配英文原文和中文译文，分六章。 https://t.co/SQr1ugqbmU https://t.co/e3SHaAkUMn", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114469269823992179"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114459602423017472"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T20:50:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114459621087707444"], "id": "2114459621087707444", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 27298, "like_count": 75, "quote_count": 14, "reply_count": 100, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114318715705548812", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Flask 作者 Armin Ronacher 在 X、Bluesky 和 Mastodon 三个平台上问了同一个问题：\n“你现在还手写超过 20% 的代码吗？”\n回答“否”，就意味着自己八成以上的代码已经交给 AI 写了。\n\nX：4,326 人投票，12.7% 回答“是”\nBluesky：91 人，26.4% 回答“是”\nMastodon：544 人投票，75.2% 回答“是” https://t.co/uwXx4xkKoY https://t.co/uR6dYNxIHZ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114459621087707444"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T19:45:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114443220432372195"], "id": "2114443220432372195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 33560, "like_count": 56, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114263137147138190", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Qwen 制裁伊朗用户？那应该也不是阿里巴巴能决定的，找阿里巴巴也没用…… https://t.co/gfe7lUmbeG", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114443220432372195"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T17:12:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114404838180078039"], "id": "2114404838180078039", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3881, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114396368769012216", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2114378681162641572", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "我这都是模型自己出的设计，那肯定是有 AI 味的\n\n如果自己有设计品味，那么可以做的很好看没有 AI 味。\n\n这里最重要的是提供一种不一样的音频/视频展现模式，让你可以自己去组合出来一些不一样的设计\n\nhttps://t.co/EsQ3RB2PVk", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114404838180078039"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T17:04:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114402733629268468"], "id": "2114402733629268468", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 895, "impression_count": 57474, "like_count": 745, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 75, "retweet_count": 132}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114035463153742180", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Techartist 用 Opus 5.5 做了本 3D 可视化物理课本《Every Joule》：十课讲完英国中学“能量”单元，免费在线看\n\n覆盖英国 GCSE 物理“能量”整章。GCSE 是英国学生 16 岁左右参加的毕业考试，大致相当于我们的中考。\n\n用 Anthropic 的 Opus 5.5 模型和 Three.js（在网页里画 3D 的开源工具）做的。 https://t.co/ofeHHakQKS", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114402733629268468"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T15:28:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114378681162641572"], "id": "2114378681162641572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 5475, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114210926253543534", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2114376993261416868", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "也不是只有一种背景和排版，我都是让它自己搭配颜色的\nhttps://t.co/vpPmOwA35o", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114378681